PART 2 -- the W-F relation and the derived outer expansion of W_inf
==============================================================================

W_inf(x;eps) := lim_{g->infinity} W(x,g;eps)
              = F(x;eps) - eps * F'(x;eps)      [this front's ATTEMPT.md
                Section 2, from W = Psi - eps Psi_x (KEY, record) plus
                hypotheses (ii)/(iii) of mclust_h1_validity_attempt SS2.3:
                lim_g Psi(x,g) = F(x), lim_g Psi_x(x,g) = F'(x)]

F(x;eps) = sum_{n>=1} eps^n psi_n(x)             [outer expansion of F,
                                                    ALREADY established,
                                                    plateau_resummation_
                                                    attempt SS4, cited not
                                                    re-derived]

=> W_inf(x;eps) = sum_n eps^n psi_n(x) - eps * sum_n eps^n psi_n'(x)
                 = sum_n eps^n [psi_n(x) - psi_{n-1}(x)']    (psi_0 := 0)
                 =: sum_n eps^n chi_n(x)

Computed chi_n(x) = psi_n(x) - psi_{n-1}'(x), n=1..4:
  chi_1(x) = R(x)
  chi_2(x) = x*R(x) - 1
  chi_3(x) = 3*x**2*R(x)/2 - 3*x/2 + 3*R(x)/2
  chi_4(x) = 13*x**3*R(x)/6 - 13*x**2/6 + 13*x*R(x)/2 - 13/3

Expressing each chi_n via Rder(n-1) to confirm the clean pattern
chi_n(x) = (gamma_n - gamma_{n-1}) * R^{(n-1)}(x):
  n=1: (gamma_1-gamma_0) = 1, predicted = R(x), chi_n - predicted = 0, MATCH=True
  n=2: (gamma_2-gamma_1) = 1, predicted = x*R(x) - 1, chi_n - predicted = 0, MATCH=True
  n=3: (gamma_3-gamma_2) = 3/2, predicted = 3*x**2*R(x)/2 - 3*x/2 + 3*R(x)/2, chi_n - predicted = 0, MATCH=True
  n=4: (gamma_4-gamma_3) = 13/6, predicted = 13*x**3*R(x)/6 - 13*x**2/6 + 13*x*R(x)/2 - 13/3, chi_n - predicted = 0, MATCH=True

CONFIRMED: chi_n(x) = (gamma_n - gamma_{n-1}) R^{(n-1)}(x) exactly,
for n=1..4, i.e.
  chi_1 = R(x),  chi_2 = R'(x),  chi_3 = (3/2) R''(x),  chi_4 = (13/6) R'''(x)
This is this front's derived 'outer expansion' for W_inf(x;eps),
new to the record (W_inf's own eps-coefficients were never before
written down explicitly, only inferred to exist via (U2)).

